# Full JMP only — compressed file banned

## Absolute rule

1. **ONLY** use `files/JMP_HSU_Ke_Cheng.pdf` (full, ~5–7 MB).
2. **`files/JMP_HSU_Ke_Cheng_compressed.pdf` must not exist.** Do not create it. Do not restore it. If it appears, delete it.
3. **NEVER** put any compressed / ~1 MB JMP into `application/**`, zips, emails, or packages.
4. The `update-jmp` script must sync **full only** and remove any compressed artifacts.

## Package inclusion

See `jmp-package-email-only.mdc`: JMP goes in the package **only for email** apps; **not for JOE**.

## Before saying an email package is ready

Confirm package JMP size matches the full `files/JMP_HSU_Ke_Cheng.pdf`, not ~1 MB.
